      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tuscumbia%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Tuscumbia sits on the north bank of the Osage River, near the junction of Routes 17 and 52.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
