      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tuscumbia%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "As Miller County’s seat, Tuscumbia hosts the county courthouse and administrative offices.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
